&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We Make Remote Work Remarkable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; • TopTalent from LatAm&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Hello! We are &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GoFasti, &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;a Talent-as-a-Service. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;GoFasti bridges the gap between world-class developers and designers from LatAm and first-class companies around the globe. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We need an English-fluent&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Development Representative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;with exceptional relationship-building skills and a believe it&#39;s possible mindset, who never stops improving, and is constantly learning the customer and giving the product team feedback, available to work remotely.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you the professional we are looking for?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead capture and prospecting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Search accounts, identify the main points of contact, and generate interest.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prospect new deals, open market to Account Executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contacting potential clients through calls, both warm and cold, and emails&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate our value proposition in a pitch to potential customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively seek new business opportunities in the market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up meetings or calls between (prospective) clients and Account Executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide feedback to management on the effectiveness of outbound phone and email campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain a database of contacts of current and future customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data entry of prospect and contact data in the CRM database&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with your prospects to build trusted relationships by providing insights tailored to their specific needs and interests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as day-to-day contact for assigned accounts, building trust and rapport while identifying areas of opportunity, highlighting best practices, and documenting them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review the customer journey, identifying how it’s supported, taking a consultative approach in helping clients overcome issues and achieve goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate interaction and workflow between project team members, including third-party service providers, to ensure deliverables are on time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate, problem solve, and/or strategize upcoming client meetings with team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare necessary documentation or visuals for client to demonstrate performance of campaigns; analyze trends in C-Sat/NPS scores to identify areas of improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the sales and marketing team to drill customer references and develop case studies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Key Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full English proficiency&lt;/strong&gt; is essential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1-2 years &lt;strong&gt;technology staff augmentation&lt;/strong&gt; sales work experience or 1-3 years of experience in communications, marketing, sales, account management, or customer success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling to the US market (preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in cold calling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong desire to be in technology and staff augmentation sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a passion for talent-as-a-service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are relentless in pursuing goals and solving problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are friendly, enthusiastic, and have professional communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to take initiative, prioritize, and manage time effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong verbal and written communication, strategic planning, and project management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working across multiple departments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active team player, self-starter, and multitasker who can quickly adjust priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Compensation:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The type of contract is a full-time Independent Contractor through a payroll platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This position has a trial period of 3 months. We are looking for SDRs to join our team in the long run, and this initial trial is an adaptation period.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The salary range for this position includes commissions, and the final compensation will be determined based on experience, seniority, and qualifications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The commission structure will be discussed during the interviews.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The developer will work REMOTELY, directly with The GoFasti Team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Here are the steps for this process:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Application review/approval &amp;gt; interview with GoFasti&#39;s team &amp;gt; profile review/approval by GoFasti Executives &amp;gt; Second interview &amp;gt; hiring and onboarding.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Once you apply for the job, our team will review your resume. If it meets the requirements, we will contact you and move forward in the process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note for Candidates Approached Directly:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you were contacted directly by a member of our team and are interested in this opportunity, please do not apply through this link. Instead, reach out to the person who contacted you to coordinate a meeting. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Thank you!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We Make Remote Work Remarkable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; • TopTalent from LatAm&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Hello! We are &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GoFasti, &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;a Talent-as-a-Service. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;GoFasti bridges the gap between world-class developers and designers from LatAm and first-class companies around the globe. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We need an English-speaking&lt;strong&gt; Mid Level 1038- Campaign Coordinator&lt;/strong&gt;, based in Latin America, available to work remotely.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are looking for someone with exceptional communication and relationship-building skills, who embraces changes while maintaining strong attention to detail. An interested and proactive person, who&#39;s constantly learning and improving their skills.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Are you the one we are looking for?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;tiptap-list-disc&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Execute optimizations across client Google Ads, Meta Ads, and emerging social platforms accounts following industry best practices.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Monitor daily campaign performance and make data-drive adjustments to improve efficiency ROI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Support day-to-day ad account maintenance and reporting.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build, monitor, and proactively deliver performance reports with a focus on scaling channel results.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Manage QA processes to ensure accuracy in ad content and on-time delivery.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Translate business objectives into actionable multi-channel strategies, including audience segmentation and retargeting.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Monitor ad platform updates and algorithm changes to proactively adjust strategies.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Work with paid search, DSP, and email teams to execute collaborative cross-channel marketing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Identify and implement fixes for low catalog match rate and product feed health to maximize efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;tiptap-list-disc&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;1–3 years of experience in digital advertising and campaign management (specifically Meta and Google Ads).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Strong understanding in setting up, monitoring and troubleshooting Meta pixels and conversion events to drive campaigns.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication; growth mindset with a desire for continuous learning.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience with other social platforms such as Pinterest, X (Twitter), or LinkedIn is a Plus.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;tiptap-list-disc&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The salary range offered for this position varies from (USD) $1,500 - $1,700 per month, depending on seniority and skillset.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a 40 hours per week.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;This position is for an independent contractor, through a payroll platform.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The talent will work remotely allocated at our client.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here are the steps for this process:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Application review/approval &lt;strong&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Screening interview with GoFasti&#39;s team &lt;strong&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt; We build and send your profile to our client &lt;strong&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Profile review/approval by client &lt;strong&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Interview with the client &lt;strong&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Hiring and onboarding.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Once you apply for the job, our team will review your resume. If it meets the requirements, we will contact you and move forward in the process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note for Candidates Approached Directly:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you were contacted directly by a member of our team and are interested in this opportunity, please do not apply through this link. Instead, reach out to the person who contacted you to coordinate a meeting. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Thank you!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We Make Remote Work Remarkable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; • TopTalent from LatAm&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Hello! We are &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GoFasti, &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;a Talent-as-a-Service. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;GoFasti bridges the gap between world-class developers and designers from LatAm and first-class companies around the globe. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We need an English-proficient&lt;strong&gt; PART-TIME Lead Developer / Architect Web3&lt;/strong&gt;, based in no, available to work remotely.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are looking for someone with exceptional communication and relationship-building skills, who embraces changes while maintaining strong attention to detail. An interested and proactive person, who&#39;s constantly learning and improving their skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you the one we are looking for?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;tiptap-list-disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the technical architecture of the platform and guide key build decisions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead and orchestrate the existing development team through sprint cycles&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive hands-on full-stack development alongside the team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Implement and oversee wallet integrations, transaction safety, and security best practices on Solana&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ensure game logic and mechanics (poker, slots, fantasy sports) are built to industry standards&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;tiptap-list-disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 2 years of experience as a Lead Developer or Software Architect on production platforms, preferably in gaming or blockchain payment projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 2 years of full-stack development experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on Solana experience (must-have).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must have gaming industry experience&lt;/strong&gt;, preferably in casino games, poker, or slots.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must have blockchain experience&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally in security, payments, or transactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must have experience leading development projects&lt;/strong&gt;, preferably in gaming or blockchain payment systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Blockchain gaming experience is a plus but not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent English communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Available immediately for part-time, project-based work with long-term potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;It&#39;s a plus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;tiptap-list-disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rust and/or Anchor framework experience (Solana smart contracts)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;TypeScript/JavaScript with React or Next.js&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with provably fair game mechanics / RNG systems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;tiptap-list-disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The salary range offered for this part-time position varies from (USD) $2,000 - $3,000 per month, depending on seniority and skillset.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is for a part time contract, through a payroll platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The talent will work remotely allocated at our client.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here are the steps for this process:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Application review/approval &lt;strong&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Screening interview with GoFasti&#39;s team &lt;strong&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt; We build and send your profile to our client &lt;strong&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Profile review/approval by client &lt;strong&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Interview with the client &lt;strong&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Hiring and onboarding.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Once you apply for the job, our team will review your resume. If it meets the requirements, we will contact you and move forward in the process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note for Candidates Approached Directly:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you were contacted directly by a member of our team and are interested in this opportunity, please do not apply through this link. Instead, reach out to the person who contacted you to coordinate a meeting. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Thank you!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We Make Remote Work Remarkable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; • TopTalent from LatAm&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Hello! We are &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GoFasti, &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;a Talent-as-a-Service. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;GoFasti bridges the gap between world-class developers and designers from LatAm and first-class companies around the globe. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We need an English-fluent&lt;strong&gt; Senior Full-Stack Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;, based in Latin America, available to work remotely.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are looking for someone with exceptional communication and relationship-building skills, who embraces changes while maintaining strong attention to detail. An interested and proactive person, who&#39;s constantly learning and improving their skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you the one we are looking for?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;tiptap-list-disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A TypeScript monorepo: a Next.js 16 web app and API, an Expo mobile app, and a Cloudflare Worker.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A PostgreSQL + Prisma data model with dozens of models and a long migration history, shared across apps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Background systems: webhook handlers (Plaid, Stripe, Linq), queued inbound-message batching, and scheduled jobs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Security-sensitive paths: encrypted bank tokens and chat content, per-user data scoping, auth across web and mobile.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The AI layer: LLM tool-calling over users&#39; financial data, long-term memory, and proactive insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reviewing AI-generated code, including your own, with a skeptical eye.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;tiptap-list-disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;6+ years as a software engineer, 3+ years shipping production TypeScript/Node backends.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Shipped work at a company that moved money or handled bank or card data (Plaid, Stripe Treasury, Unit, Synapse-era BaaS, card issuing, lending, payroll).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deep PostgreSQL: migrations safe to run on live data, indexes, transactions, query plans.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Real experience with async systems: idempotency, retries, deduplicating webhooks, jobs that fail halfway.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A security-first instinct around PII, encryption at rest, auth tokens and least privilege.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Solo ownership of production at least once: on-call, reading error tracking, writing root-cause analyses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Daily use of AI coding tools (Claude Code, Cursor or similar), and clear views on where they go wrong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Written English good enough that a PR description or incident write-up needs no follow-up questions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;It&#39;s a plus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;tiptap-list-disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Plaid in production: webhooks, item re-authentication, transaction sync cursors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;LLMs in production: tool-calling, prompt evaluation, cost and latency control.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Next.js App Router and React Server Components.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SMS or messaging compliance (opt-outs, TCPA), or Stripe subscription billing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Expo / React Native.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;tiptap-list-disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The salary range offered for this position varies from (USD) $3,000 - $3,200 per month, depending on seniority and skillset.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is for a full time contract, through a payroll platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The talent will work remotely allocated at our client.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here are the steps for this process:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Application review/approval &lt;strong&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Screening interview with GoFasti&#39;s team &lt;strong&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt; We build and send your profile to our client &lt;strong&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Profile review/approval by client &lt;strong&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Interview with the client &lt;strong&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Hiring and onboarding.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Once you apply for the job, our team will review your resume. If it meets the requirements, we will contact you and move forward in the process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note for Candidates Approached Directly:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you were contacted directly by a member of our team and are interested in this opportunity, please do not apply through this link. Instead, reach out to the person who contacted you to coordinate a meeting. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Thank you!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We Make Remote Work Remarkable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; • TopTalent from LatAm&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
