ning and leading Cisco ThousandEyes deployments at enterprise scale.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Deep expertise across all ThousandEyes test types (Network, DNS, HTTP Server, Page Load, Voice, BGP) and agent types (Cloud, Enterprise, Endpoint), including large-scale rollout and rationalization.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Expert-level knowledge of routing protocols (BGP, OSPF), TCP/IP, DNS, HTTP/HTTPS, SD-WAN (Cisco Viptela/Meraki), and cloud connectivity architectures (AWS Direct Connect, Azure ExpressRoute, GCP Interconnect).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Proven experience leading client-facing discovery, architecture design, and presales/SOW scoping engagements.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Strong scripting and automation skills (Python, ThousandEyes API, Terraform) for integration and reporting at scale.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;CCNP or CCIE (or equivalent advanced networking certification) required; Cisco ThousandEyes certification strongly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience integrating ThousandEyes with ITSM/SIEM platforms (ServiceNow, Splunk) and broader observability stacks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Exceptional executive communication, consulting, and presentation skills, with the ability to advise C-level and IT leadership stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated ability to mentor technical teams and lead globally distributed, cross-time-zone engagements.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;It&#39;s a plus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;tiptap-list-disc&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience integrating ThousandEyes telemetry into broader ITSM, SIEM, and observability ecosystems (e.g., ServiceNow, Splunk).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience sizing engagements, developing Statements of Work (SOWs), and presenting solutions with Sales/Presales teams.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Proven 