&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Hello! We are &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GoFasti, &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;a Talent-as-a-Service. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;GoFasti bridges the gap between world-class developers and designers from LatAm and first-class companies around the globe. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We need an English-fluent&lt;strong&gt; Analytics Project Manager&lt;/strong&gt;, based in Latin America, available to work remotely.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are looking for someone with exceptional communication and relationship-building skills, who embraces changes while maintaining strong attention to detail. An interested and proactive person, who&#39;s constantly learning and improving their skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you the one we are looking for?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;tiptap-list-disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coordinate work between the ERP, data lake and analytics layers of the solution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Detect process changes with different teams and translate them into impacts on analytics solutions, such as affected data fields.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead testing across all project waves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manage resources and track resource usage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Synchronize solutions across ERPs, the data lake, other data sources and the analytics products being built.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Keep local analytics teams, local business stakeholders and the project team informed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coordinate and lead knowledge transfer between analytics and IT teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coordinate documentation and knowledge-transfer sign-off.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monitor and assess the impact of each wave.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;tiptap-list-disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5+ years of proven experience managing or coordinating data, analytics, or IT projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience working across ERP, data platform, and analytics/BI teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to understand how business process changes affect data models, fields and reports.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience leading testing cycles and coordinating sign-offs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong stakeholder management and communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fluent, business-level English.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;It&#39;s a plus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;tiptap-list-disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hands-on analytics experience (for example, SQL, Power BI, or Databricks).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with SAP S/4HANA implementations or migrations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;tiptap-list-disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The salary range offered for this position varies from (USD) $2,500 - $3,500 per month, depending on seniority and skillset.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;is&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;a&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;one-year&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;project&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;with&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;the&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;possibility&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;of&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;an&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;extension&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;based&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;on&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;the&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;client&#39;s&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is for a full time contract, through a payroll platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The talent will work remotely allocated at our client.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here are the steps for this process:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Application review/approval &lt;strong&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Screening interview with GoFasti&#39;s team &lt;strong&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt; We build and send your profile to our client &lt;strong&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Profile review/approval by client &lt;strong&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Interview with the client &lt;strong&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Hiring and onboarding.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Once you apply for the job, our team will review your resume. If it meets the requirements, we will contact you and move forward in the process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note for Candidates Approached Directly:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you were contacted directly by a member of our team and are interested in this opportunity, please do not apply through this link. Instead, reach out to the person who contacted you to coordinate a meeting. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Thank you!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
